307
00:13:07.854 --> 00:13:08.920
[Emma chuckles softly]

308
00:13:08.922 --> 00:13:10.155
[chuckling]

309
00:13:10.157 --> 00:13:11.990
[sighs]

310
00:13:12.926 --> 00:13:16.327
