311
00:13:16.329 --> 00:13:17.796
Choo-choo!

312
00:13:18.465 --> 00:13:19.798
Madame.

313
00:13:19.800 --> 00:13:20.965
Thank you.

314
00:13:20.967 --> 00:13:22.367
[Connor sighs]

315
00:13:24.204 --> 00:13:25.336
[groans]

316
00:13:25.338 --> 00:13:26.504
