is she?

328
00:13:52.532 --> 00:13:54.199
Well, of course she's using you.

329
00:13:54.201 --> 00:13:58.169
She's just...
looking for a free handyman.

330
00:13:58.171 --> 00:14:01.105
Yeah, I should have realized.
She asked me on our first date

331
